WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.590
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:17.460
Last time: people who build with computers

3
00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:24.240
Chapter 2 · How Apps We Use Actually Work

4
00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:38.390
Every app follows the same 3 steps!

5
00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:46.180
Sunday trip to India Gate!

6
00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:52.910
Papa isn't sure of the way…

7
00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:57.830
You type "India Gate" into the maps app

8
00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:03.000
A blue route appears in a second!

9
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:09.130
How did the app know the way? Think!

10
00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:20.510
Give it something · It works · It shows a result

11
00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:27.220
Input → Process → Output

12
00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:33.570
Input: what you GIVE the app

13
00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:39.960
Process: the work it does INSIDE

14
00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:47.670
Output: what it SHOWS or SAYS back

15
00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:54.040
Think of the mixie in your kitchen

16
00:01:54.040 --> 00:02:08.110
Mango & milk → Blend → Mango shake!

17
00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:16.930
In → Work → Out. Apps do it too!

18
00:02:16.930 --> 00:02:27.550
INPUT: you type "India Gate"

19
00:02:27.550 --> 00:02:40.050
PROCESS: the app finds a good path

20
00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:45.940
OUTPUT: the route drawn on the map

21
00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:56.710
"Turn left in 200 metres" is output too!

22
00:02:56.710 --> 00:03:04.470
Camera INPUT: press the button

23
00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:09.420
PROCESS: the app saves the picture

24
00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:16.220
OUTPUT: the photo on the screen

25
00:03:16.220 --> 00:03:26.080
Your favourite app: what goes in and out?

26
00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:32.240
Detective time: a quiz app!

27
00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:39.190
Tap → Check → Green tick

28
00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:48.690
Which part is the PROCESS?

29
00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:56.900
Process = checking if it's right!

30
00:03:56.900 --> 00:04:08.290
You watch cricket… and more cricket!

31
00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:17.380
Again and again = a PATTERN

32
00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:28.250
Pattern noticed → more cricket next!

33
00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:36.650
More about patterns when we study AI!

34
00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:46.430
True or false: apps never decide for you?

35
00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:57.890
False! Apps decide some things for you

36
00:04:57.890 --> 00:05:09.840
Apps only suggest. You still choose!

37
00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:13.790
Your turn: practice check

38
00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:25.100
Maps app: what's the input? The output?

39
00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:38.860
Input: place typed · Output: route & directions

40
00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:46.740
Input → Process → Output

41
00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:51.720
Maps: place in → path found → route out

42
00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:54.870
Video apps notice patterns

43
00:05:54.870 --> 00:06:00.690
Apps decide some things. You still choose!

44
00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:07.720
Chapter 2 done!

45
00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:14.520
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
